    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let go of the struggle and finally rest\"... that sounds so peaceful. but it also feels so heavy. like, is it even more dignified to just leave before the decay becomes too ugly to bear? or is there some kind of virtue in just sitting here and suffering through the mess?",
